{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-act-11-1","title":"Acts 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Peter, being accused for going in to the Gentiles, 5 makes his defence; 18 which is accepted. 19 The gospel being spread in Phenice, and Cyprus, and Antioch, Barnabas is sent to confirm them. 26 The disciples there are first called Christians. 27 They send relief to the brethren in Judea in time of famine.</p>\n<p>the apostles. 8:14,15; Ga 1:17-22 the Gentiles. 10:34-38; 14:27; 15:3; Ge 49:10; Ps 22:27; 96:1-10; Isa 11:10; 32:15 Isa 35:1,2; 42:1,6; 49:6; 52:10; 60:3; 62:2; Jer 16:19; Ho 2:23 Am 9:11,12; Mic 5:7; Zep 2:11; 3:9; Zec 2:11; 8:20-23; Mal 1:11 Mt 8:11; Mr 16:5; Lu 2:32; Ro 15:7-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-11-2","title":"Acts 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>they. 10:9,45; 15:1,5; 21:20-23; Ga 2:12-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-11-3","title":"Acts 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>10:23,28,48; Lu 15:2; 1Co 5:11; 2Jo 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-11-4","title":"Acts 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>14:27; Jos 22:21-31; Pr 15:1; Lu 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-11-5","title":"Acts 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>was. 10:9-18 in a. 22:17; 2Co 12:1-3 and it. Jer 1:11-14; Eze 2:9; Am 7:4-7; 8:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-11-6","title":"Acts 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>fastened. 3:4; Lu 4:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-11-8","title":"Acts 11:8","author":"R. A. Torrey